"WP1026005","name":{"zh":"束发","en":"Hair Tie"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"用来束起长发的简单布条，简单有效。","en":"A simple cloth strip for tying up long hair. Simple and effective."},"mp":"100","price":"200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1029715","code":"100"}]},"otherRelationship":{"label":{"zh":"其他关系","en":"Other relationships"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10038","code":"4"},{"id":"WJ1040515","code":"3"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI100915","name":{"zh":"琅琊王氏","en":"The Wang clan of Langya"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，周灵王太子晋之后，秦朝名将王翦曾孙‌王元‌为避战乱迁居琅琊郡，成为当地顶级望族。魏晋南北朝第一流高门，被誉为'华夏首望‌''王与马，共天下'。王导、王敦奠定东晋门阀政治。六朝后逐渐没落，昔日王谢堂前燕，飞入寻常百姓家。","en":"Descended from the Ji surname as scions of Prince Jin, son of King Ling of Zhou. Wang Yuan, great-grandson of the renowned Qin general Wang Jian, relocated to Langya Commandery to avoid warfare, establishing the family as the foremost prominent house of the region. Standing as the premier illustrious clan throughout the Wei, Jin, Southern and Northern Dynasties, they were lauded as the 'Premier Clan of Huaxia' and celebrated in the proverb 'The Wangs and the Sima share the realm.' Wang Dao and Wang Dun laid the foundation for the aristocratic factional politics of the Eastern Jin. Gradually declining after the Six Dynasties, their legacy is remembered in the verse: 'The swallows that once nested before the halls of Wang and Xie now fly into the homes of common folk.'"},"talent":{"military":"1","commerce":"4","politics":"9"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"王睿","height":"平均","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"r