1","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10058","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,13,65,71,69,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉官员，王祥伯父，出身琅琊王氏。中平末年任荆州刺史，治所设江陵，曾与长沙太守孙坚合作讨伐零陵、桂阳叛军，但因孙坚为武官而多有轻慢。董卓之乱时他欲举兵讨董，却因与武陵太守曹寅不和扬言先杀之，曹寅恐惧之下伪造光禄大夫温毅檄文，唆使孙坚以‘奉诏讨罪’为名突袭江陵。王睿被围后登楼质问，孙坚以‘坐无所知’回应，穷迫之下吞金自杀，死后刘表继任荆州刺史。","tc":"東漢官員，王祥伯父，出身瑯琊王氏。中平末年任荊州刺史，治所設江陵，曾與長沙太守孫堅合作討伐零陵、桂陽叛軍，但因孫堅為武官而多有輕慢。董卓之亂時他欲舉兵討董，卻因與武陵太守曹寅不和揚言先殺之，曹寅恐懼之下偽造光祿大夫溫毅檄文，唆使孫堅以‘奉詔討罪’為名突襲江陵。王睿被圍后登樓質問，孫堅以‘坐無所知’回應，窮迫之下吞金自殺，死后劉表繼任荊州刺史。","en":"An official of the Later Han, uncle to Wang Xiang, and a member of the Wang clan of Langya. In the late Zhongping era, he served as Lt. Governor of Jing Province with his seat at Jiangling. He once collaborated with Governor of Changsha Sun Jian to subjugate rebels in Lingling and Guiyang, but often slighted Sun Jian for being a Warrior. During Dong Zhuo's turmoil, he intended to raise troops against Dong Zhuo, yet due to a feud with Governor of Wuling Cao Yin, he declared he would execute Cao first. Terrified, Cao Yin forged a summons from Minister of Oration Wen Yi, instigating Sun Jian to make a surprise attack on Jiangling under the pretext of ‘punishing crimes by imperial decree.’ Besieged, Wang Rui ascended a tower to demand an explanation, to which Sun Jian answered, ‘Guilty of knowing nothing.’ In utter despair, Wang Rui swallowed gold and committed suicide. Following his death, Liu Biao succeeded him as Lt. Governor of Jing Province.","jp":"後漢の官僚で王祥の伯父。琅邪王氏の出身。中平年間の末期に荊州刺史に任じられ、治所を江陵に置いた。かつて長沙太守の孫堅と協力して零陵や桂陽の反乱軍を討伐したが、孫堅が武官であったため軽んじることが多かった。董卓の乱の際に挙兵して董卓を討とうとしたが、武陵太守の曹寅と不仲であり、まず曹寅を殺すと公言した。恐れをなした曹寅は光禄大夫温毅の檄文を偽造し、孫堅を唆して「詔を奉じて罪を討つ」との名目で江陵を急襲させた。王叡は包囲されると楼に登って詰問したが、孫堅に「坐無所知（罪を犯しながら自覚がない）」と返され、追い詰められて金を呑んで自害した。死後は劉表が荊州刺史を継いだ。","kr":"후한의 관리이자 왕상의 백부로, 낭야 왕씨 출신이다. 중평 말년에 형주자사로 임명되어 강릉에 치소를 두었으며, 일찍이 장사태수 손견과 협력하여 영릉과 계양의 반란군을 토벌했으나 손견이 무관이라는 이유로 번번이 홀대했다. 동탁의 난이 일어나자 거병하여 동탁을 토벌하려 했으나, 평소 불화가 있던 무릉태수 조인을 먼저 처단하겠다고 공언했다. 이에 겁을 먹은 조인이 광록대부 온의의 격문을 위조하여 손견을 부추겨 '조서를 받들어 죄를 토벌한다'는 명분으로 강릉을 기습하게 했다. 왕예는 포위당하자 누각에 올라 연유를 따져 물었으나 손견이 '그저 아는 바가 없다'고 답하자, 궁지에 몰려 금을 삼키고 자결했다. 그가 죽은 후 유표가 후임 형주자사로 부임했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1040415","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"睿","nameTc":"睿","nameEn":"Rui","nameJp":"叡","nameKr":"예","nameOther":"","word":"通耀","wordTc":"通耀","wordEn":"Tongyao","wordJp":"通耀","wordKr":"통요","wordOther":"","icon":"王睿","power":"WJ10058","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1005","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"13","wise":"65","politics":"71","charm":"69","will":"51","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"10/10/10/10/10/65/10/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2700","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"4500","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/2/2/2/0/1/0/3/0/1/1/0/2/2/1/0/3/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"28","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","evaluate":"-2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"141","show":"184","death":"190","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;13/1;59/1;45/2;40/2;37/2;24/1;8/1;42/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ1029715/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10038/4;WJ1040515/3","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"东汉官员，王祥伯父，出身琅琊王氏。中平末年任荆州刺史，治所设江陵，曾与长沙太守孙坚合作讨伐零陵、桂阳叛军，但因孙坚为武官而多有轻慢。董卓之乱时他欲举兵讨董，却因与武陵太守曹寅不和扬言先杀之，曹寅恐惧之下伪造光禄大夫